  Script 0: Predictive search performance — debounce + cache + limit optimisation.

  Debounce (150ms): waits until the user pauses typing before firing the
  /search/suggest API call. Typing "laptop" quickly sends 1 request instead
  of 6, reducing server load and eliminating jitter from stale results.

  Limit optimisation: rewrites resources[limit]=10 → resources[limit]=5 so
  Shopify fetches and renders only as many products as we display.
  Reduces server-side Liquid rendering time.

  Cache (12 entries, per page-load): revisiting a recent query is served
  from memory instantly — zero network round-trip.

